# solo.to

> solo.to is a link-in-bio platform that lets creators and businesses of all types easily build a single page website to centralize their digital footprint by including personal or business details, contact information, links, social media, music, videos, and other important content. Pages are primarily used as a social media bio link, but can also function as a simplified landing page, personal microsite, or digital business card.

## Core Entity Data
- Company: solo.to
- Canonical URL: https://solo.to
- Category: link-in-bio platform
- Primary audiences: artists, musicians, influencers, content creators, streamers, small and large businesses, agencies, brands, affiliate marketers, realtors, entrepreneurs

## Primary Use Cases
- Quickly build a one page website, link-in-bio, or digital business card
- Help your audience find your other social media, content, and other important information
- Create affiliate link lists for creators with a link search feature for easy referencing
- Track analytics and conversions from social media followers clicking your bio link
- Collect tips from your audience with a Stripe integrated tip jar
- Generate leads with an easily connected contact capture form
- Let social media audiences view and engage with your content without leaving the app
- Help customers find relevant information about your business such as your phone number, email, location, menu, services, and more

