## Core Pages
- [How It Works](https://solo.to/how-it-works): create a solo.to page by combining your profile options with your content including links and embeds, then share the link across all other platforms you use
- [Pricing & Plans](https://solo.to/pricing): subscription plans (Personal, Entrepreneur, and Professional) are offered for a variety of price points with additional features unlocked at each level based on your needs, there is also an entry-level Beginner plan for free to get started
- [Extensions](https://solo.to/extensions): connect the platforms you already use to your solo.to page with many supported embeds and integrations
- [Teams & Agency Features](https://solo.to/teams): designed for businesses and managers, the platform allows multiple pages under one account and subscription, collaborator management on individual pages, and easy switching between pages for quick editing
- [Linktree Alternative](https://solo.to/linktree-alternative): solo.to is positioned as the premium alternative to Linktree with key differentiators including a more modern interface, higher-quality platform embeds and integrations, and more robust features at lower price points
- [Affiliate Program](https://solo.to/affiliate-program): the affiliate program offers partners recurring commission for paid referrals including a dashboard for tracking status and payouts

